      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "师傅听完八重无敌的说法后，\n默默沉思了一段时间。\n──然后，他开口问道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06362d28e73486d0a3bac47130187a782da21740582d0c0b30a4371ddd209c70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
