      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯……训练员对此有何看法？\n你觉得八重没有成长……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6f851cecb668d740e7f28cd055fe69fa148004ca599b56013e25274e46669b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
