    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12004c8797b83e88eb48c630",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她持续奔跑了三年，中途遭遇过各种难关，\n但八重无敌还是想赢，\n并一路努力过来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "110eff04bf642a581fa0e261816f76c8f5b860f5fb2d992615c8727dd2b0c346",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf70556ae947d4b55115906f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后她赢过了众多强敌。\n怎么可以说这不是成长呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12e4fd48bcf81d3151c27573b8c02792e0e85eed760e3a252d39cc82d234f20b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
